! SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
! Oblikovati exporter menu (Python journal edition). NX reads this from
! <UGII_USER_DIR>/startup at launch and adds an "Export to Oblikovati" item under the
! File menu that PLAYS the oblikovati_export.py journal shipped beside it. A journal needs
! no compiled, code-signed DLL, so this loads on any NX seat that can play journals.
VERSION 120

EDIT UG_GATEWAY_MAIN_MENUBAR

AFTER UG_FILE_EXPORT
BUTTON OBLIKOVATI_EXPORT
LABEL Export to Oblikovati...
ACTIONS oblikovati_export.py
END_OF_AFTER
